# install-age.manifest — Explicit list of scaffold files to copy into a target project.
# One path per line, relative to the template root. Lines starting with # are comments.
# The installer reads this file line-by-line; existing target files are SKIPPED.
#
# This manifest intentionally EXCLUDES template-internal artifacts:
#   - docs/articles/                  (methodology articles, not project content)
#   - docs/architecture/mission-driver-baseline.md   (engine's own baseline)
#   - docs/audits/mission-driver-*/   (engine's own audit records)
#   - docs/backlog/mission-driver-*-roadmap.md, demo-roadmap.md  (engine's roadmaps)
#   - docs/discussions/2026-*         (engine's own discussions)
#   - docs/logs/2026/                 (engine's own daily logs)
#   - docs/plans/mission-driver-*/, docs/plans/2026-*  (engine's own plans)
#   - docs/requirements/mission-driver-convergence-and-cost-optimization.md
#   - docs/retrospectives/template-design-decisions.md  (template's evolution record)
# When adding new scaffold files to the template, add them HERE too.

# --- root ---
AGENTS.md

# --- docs root ---
docs/index.md

# --- docs/context (mandatory AI context — ALL) ---
docs/context/README.md
docs/context/project-context.md
docs/context/ai-autonomy-policy.md
